  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tSME User Information\n\t\tGeneral\n\n### User Guide - SME\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 6 May, 2020 at 12:05 PM\n\n\t\tThis Article has been created to provide new SME users with a guide on how best to start using Capium.\n\nEach section of this guide contains an article and a video which contain step-by-step processes to setting up the Bookkeeping & Payroll, as well as on how to import data.,\n\nThe below articles are set to be in Chronological order, representing the order you should follow when using Capium for the first time.\n\nBookkeeping\n\n1. Accounting Period Set Up\n\n2. Chart of Accounts \n\n3a. Contacts Import (Customers)\n\n3b. Contacts Import (Suppliers)\n\n4. Opening Balance Import\n\n5. Purchase Invoice Import\n\n6. Sales Invoice Import\n\n7. Import Receipts & Payments\n\n8. Bank Transactions Import\n\n9. Bank Feeds Set Up (Optional)\n\nPayroll\n\n1. Payroll Settings\n\n2. Employee Import\n\n3. Year To Date Import (If applicable)\n\n4. Auto-Enrollment Set Up\n\n5. Process Payroll\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000117302\">SME User Information</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000195365\">General</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">User Guide - SME\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Wed, 6 May, 2020 at 12:05 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p>This Article has been created to provide new SME users with a guide on how best to start using Capium.</p><p><br></p><p>Each section of this guide contains an article and a video which contain step-by-step processes to setting up the Bookkeeping &amp; Payroll, as well as on how to import data.,</p><p><br></p><p>The below articles are set to be in Chronological order, representing the order you should follow when using Capium for the first time.</p><p><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"464\"><strong><u><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Bookkeeping</span></u></strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"464\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"488\"><a href=\"https://support.capium.com/support/solutions/articles/9000165221-adding-an-accounting-period\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>1. Accounting Period Set Up</strong></a></p><p data-identifyelement=\"489\"><strong><br></strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"483\"><strong><a href=\"https://support.capium.com/support/solutions/articles/9000165220-chart-of-accounts-coa-\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2. Chart of Accounts </a></strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"483\"><strong><br></strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"469\"><strong><a href=\"https://support.capium.com/support/solutions/articles/9000149747-1-6-customer-import-contacts-\">3a. Contacts Import (Customers)</a></strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"469\"><strong><br></strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"472\"><strong><a href=\"https://support.capium.com/support/solutions/articles/9000149749-1-7-importing-suppliers-contacts-\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">3b. Contacts Import (Suppliers)</a></strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"476\"><strong><br></strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"478\"><strong><a href=\"https://support.capium.com/support/solutions/articles/9000149821-1-8-importing-opening-balance\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">4. Opening Balance Import</a></strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"478\"><strong><br></strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"479\"><strong><a href=\"https://support.capium.com/support/solutions/articles/9000149741-importing-purchase-invoices\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">5. Purchase Invoice Import</a></strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"479\"><strong><br></strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"479\"><strong><a href=\"https://support.capium.com/support/solutions/articles/9000149738-importing-sales-invoices\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">6. Sales Invoice Import</a></strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"479\"><strong><br></strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"479\"><strong><a href=\"https://support.capium.com/support/solutions/articles/9000149742-importing-receipts-payments-quick-entry-\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">7. Import Receipts &amp; Payments</a></strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"479\"><strong><br></strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"479\"><strong><a href=\"https://support.capium.com/support/solutions/articles/9000149744-1-5-importing-bank-imports\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">8. Bank Transactions Import</a></strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"479\"><stron